<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mandela postpones trip to S.E. Asia.</title>
<headline>Mandela postpones trip to S.E. Asia.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African President Nelson Mandela has postponed a visit next week to Singapore, Malaysia, Brunei and the Philippines, the foreign ministry said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;President Mandela has been in contact with the heads of state of the four countries concerned to inform them personally of the postponement,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>No reasons were given for the postponement and no new date has been released.</p>
</text>
